      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home to the market, ideally situated in a quiet cul-de-sac in the highly sought-after Hunters Run development, Clonee, Dublin 15.\nHunters Run enjoys an excellent location close to a wealth of local amenities including schools, shops and recreational facilities. The property is also ideally positioned for commuters with easy access to the M50 motorway, making travel throughout Dublin and beyond both convenient and straightforward.\nBright and well-proportioned internal accommodation extending to approximately c. 102 sq. briefly comprises an entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area, three well-appointed bedrooms and three bathrooms. Externally, No. 31 benefits from a large SOUTH/WEST sunny rear garden together with a generous driveway providing off-street parking for two cars. The property is also ideally positioned opposite a large green area, providing an attractive outlook and further enhancing its excellent setting.\nNo. 31 comes to the market in immaculate condition throughout and benefits from gas fired central heating. The property is vacant and offered with no onward chain, making it an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families and those looking to trade up.\nGiven the prime location, excellent condition and attractive setting, we expect this property to be extremely popular.\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n• C. 102 sq.m\n• 3 Bed / 3 Bath Semi-Detached\n• BER C Rated\n• Vacant with no onward chain\n• Immaculate condition throughout\n• Quiet cul-de-sac location\n• Large sunny SOUTH/WEST facing rear garden\n• Generous driveway with parking for 2 cars\n• Overlooking a large green area\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Prime location\n• Close to schools and shops\n• Easy access to the M50 motorway\n• Ideal family home\n• Ideal for first-time buyers and those trading up\n• Early viewing strongly advised"
      },
      {
